  "slug": "room-block-checklist-form",
  "title": "Room Block Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "The pre-arrival readiness check: rooming list loaded, rooms assigned, keys and welcome packets ready, billing routed, and accessible rooms confirmed.",
  "description": "An original pre-arrival readiness check for a group room block. It records the check identity and the block under check, rooming-list and reservation accuracy, room assignment and readiness including accessible rooms, arrival-day logistics, the release decision before the group arrives, blocking findings, and the handoff to front office.",
  "use_case": "Use in the days before a group arrives, when reservations and front office verify that the block in the system matches the order and every named guest has a room. The check closes when the block is released for arrival or blocking findings are escalated.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
