        {
          "key": "check_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "What this check does and does not establish",
          "guidance": "This check records whether the block in the system matches the order and whether committed rooms are assigned. It does not certify that a room meets any accessibility standard, and it does not resolve a rate or attrition dispute. Route an accessible room that cannot be delivered as promised, or a block that is oversold, to the responsible manager before the guest arrives."
        }
      ]
